+R_StudioDrawXray
+
+H9: renderfx 64 is ts_matchmode's sudden-death marker (TSM_RENDERFX_XRAY), a value
+neither GoldSrc's enum (it ends at 20) nor Xash's (it ends at 21) uses. A model sent
